{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le08ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le08ob04re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le08ob04re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn11le08ob04re2img01.jpg", "text": "Stephen had a terrible fight with his girlfriend Elizabeth. He regretted it the moment he got home. What exactly the cause of the problem was, he did not know. Regardless, he called Elizabeth to apologize and to beg her forgiveness, but she refused to speak to him. It seemed as though all possible options had been exhausted, so what Stephen did was send his friend Irwin to talk to Elizabeth. When Irwin came back, he gave Stephen the following report:", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn11le08ob04re2img02.jpg", "text": "I had a long talk with Elizabeth. We talked about how you are always so inconsiderate, how she always puts up with your guff, and how you always get on her nerves. What she hates most is your constant nagging. She mentioned that you were often distant and cold. As to where all of this animosity is coming from, she could not say.", "id": 2, "time": "33000"}, {"image": "engenn11le08ob04re2img03.jpg", "text": "I asked her whether she was sick of your hostility, if she wanted to try to forget about you and whether she was certain that she wouldn't have any regrets. She said that she wasn't sure, and that she would need a bit of time to think about it. I asked her whether she would miss you, and if she still loved you despite all of the things you had done. Again she said that she didn't know for certain. I asked her whether she wanted you to call her, if she had a message for you, and why she was so enraged. Once more, she couldn't give me a straight answer. I asked her if she wanted to break up with you and whether she was interested in someone else. She gave me another vague response.\n<br/><br/>\nI was out of ideas, so finally I asked her if she would like to go out with me next week. At last I got a clear answer. She said yes!", "id": 3, "time": "59000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about people's personalities, love and marriage.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can use proper intonation in non-final thought groups.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can change emphasis by changing word order.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you remember the last time you were in an argument? What was it about?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " In your opinion, what is the best way to resolve an argument?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Pronunciation Spot: Let's find out if Irwin can sort things out!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nStephen and Elizabeth are having a fight. Will they <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">make up</span>?\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"conte